Performance review. The code or data is supplied inline. This is a diagnosis-only task: do NOT edit or create any file and do not run commands; respond with findings and a proposed fix as text. Be explicit about what you measured versus what you are inferring.

This function runs for every line of every dispatch-log tail (millions of lines per day) in the metrics ingester.

```go
func classify(line string) (string, bool) {
	re := regexp.MustCompile(`"agent":"([a-z0-9-]+)","exit":(\d+)`)
	m := re.FindStringSubmatch(line)
	if m == nil {
		return "", false
	}
	key := fmt.Sprintf("%s|%s", m[1], m[2])
	tags := []string{}
	for _, t := range strings.Split(m[1], "-") {
		tags = append(tags, strings.ToUpper(t))
	}
	return key + "|" + strings.Join(tags, "."), true
}
```
